  {
    "id": "spellfire_shield",
    "name": "咒火护盾",
    "category": "feat",
    "mode": "passive",
    "parameters": {},
    "outputs": [],
    "resources": {
      "fire_energy": {
        "label": "火能量吸收",
        "initial": 0,
        "min": "0",
        "max": "ability.constitution",
        "integer": true,
        "playerEditable": true
      }
    },
    "notes": [
      {
        "text": "你可以吸收火属性法术的伤害，每级法术储存一点火能量；当前{resources.fire_energy}／{ability.constitution}。",
        "category": "combat",
        "when": "resources.fire_energy < ability.constitution"
      },
      {
        "text": "你可以释放火能量，以400尺内远程接触攻击发射：每消耗1点能量造成1d6伤害，其中一半为火焰伤害；DC20反射成功伤害减半。也可近战接触，每消耗1点能量治疗2点伤害。消耗数量由你决定，手动修改资源。",
        "category": "combat",
        "when": "resources.fire_energy > 0"
      }
    ]
  },
